&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;IDnow is a&lt;strong&gt; leader in digital identity and fraud prevention in Europe&lt;/strong&gt; with a mission to transform trust into the most powerful asset in the digital world, empowering enterprises with &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven, SaaS-based identity solutions that deliver scalable security, adaptive compliance, and real-time fraud prevention&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;Through its broad portfolio of digital identity and fraud prevention solutions, IDnow establishes, maintains and enriches trust throughout the customer journey, ensuring businesses can confidently and securely operate while leveraging digital identity to drive growth, security and scalability. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;fabric-text-color-mark&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-text-custom-color=&quot;#36b37e&quot;&gt;The company has &lt;strong&gt;offices in Germany, United Kingdom, Romania and France&lt;/strong&gt;, and is backed by renowned institutional investors, including Corsair Capital and Seventure Partners. Its &lt;strong&gt;portfolio of international clients spans a wide range of end markets&lt;/strong&gt; including financial services, telecommunications, travel &amp;amp; mobility, gaming, and other industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based in Munich or in Berlin, Germany.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW222750527 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW222750527 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91521066 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91521066 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW234133297 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW234133297 BCX0&quot;&gt;W&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW222750527 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW222750527 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91521066 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91521066 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW234133297 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW234133297 BCX0&quot;&gt;e’re recruiting a Product Manager to drive our automated identity verification solution, delivering compliance, security, and performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW222750527 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW222750527 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW91521066 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW91521066 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;We are hiring a Senior Product Manager to own the end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;end product lifecycle: capture market and customer needs, shape strategy and roadmap, and drive delivery with engineering. You will advise sales and customer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NoBreakHyphenBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;‑&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;facing teams and work directly with customers on product setup and solution patterns. The immediate priority is supporting customer migrations to a new platform driven by regulatory change; the role will broaden to encompass&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;additional&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;capabilities on the new platform over time. You will collaborate closely with Product &amp;amp; Technology Leadership and Sales Leadership across&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;DACH&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;and other markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;IDnow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;provides GenAI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot;&gt;enabled tooling and expects responsible, compliant use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW21924362 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Business outcome ownership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: define measurable goals and KPIs (adoption, quality, satisfaction) and drive outcome-oriented delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Roadmapping&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&amp;nbsp;maintain&amp;nbsp;an outcome-focused roadmap that converts market, regulatory and customer insights into prioritized initiatives; align with leadership and sales.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Delivery &amp;amp; specification&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: translate roadmap items into epics, user&amp;nbsp;stories&amp;nbsp;and testable acceptance criteria; lead backlog refinement, sprint&amp;nbsp;planning&amp;nbsp;and reviews; make trade&lt;/span&gt;‑&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;offs on scope,&amp;nbsp;quality&amp;nbsp;and timelines; coordinate release readiness and enablement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Incident triage &amp;amp; quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;:&amp;nbsp;rapidly&amp;nbsp;triage issues, gather context, coordinate fixes, run post-incident reviews and capture preventive actions in the backlog; communicate status to customer-facing teams and customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Migration support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: help define pragmatic migration plans, cutover guidance, deprecation&amp;nbsp;strategies&amp;nbsp;and customer enablement materials; track adoption and surface risks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Customer engagement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: join customer meetings with Sales and Customer Success to&amp;nbsp;validate&amp;nbsp;value propositions via interviews,&amp;nbsp;prototypes&amp;nbsp;and pilots.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;GenAI-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;‑&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;enabled ways of working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: use GenAI to accelerate discovery, specification, incident&amp;nbsp;summaries&amp;nbsp;and reporting—ensuring human oversight and compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Degree in Business, Computer&amp;nbsp;Science&amp;nbsp;or related field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;8 y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;ears in product roles with end-to-end ownership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Proven&amp;nbsp;customer&amp;nbsp;facing&amp;nbsp;experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technical&amp;nbsp;fluency&amp;nbsp;(APIs/architecture).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Agile&amp;nbsp;proficiency&amp;nbsp;(Jira/Confluence).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Practical, responsible use of GenAI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience with Enterprise customer migration is preferable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;German and English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing:&lt;/strong&gt; Use your full access to the mental health platform &lt;em&gt;nilo&lt;/em&gt;, including 1on1 sessions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value&lt;strong&gt; personal and professional development:&lt;/strong&gt; make full use of &lt;em&gt;Udemy&lt;/em&gt;, our training platform with 24/7 access and unlimited content/course consumption incl. certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We make your &lt;strong&gt;remote work comfy:&lt;/strong&gt; we provide support on equipment and offer flexible working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value collaboration &amp;amp; love to come together: regular&lt;strong&gt; onsite gatherings, internal initiatives&lt;/strong&gt; and summer parties to connect outside of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;May your family require your attention or other reasons apply: use the benefit of our&lt;strong&gt; paid &lt;/strong&gt;special&lt;strong&gt; leave days.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy the possibility to combine work with a longer stay at your holiday destination or extend a weekend with our&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Workcation possibilities.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In addition to the perks &amp;amp; benefits above, we offer &lt;strong&gt;specific benefits that differ between our locations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IDnow applies the principles of non-discrimination and equality: We strive to establish, maintain, and promote an open and inclusive recruitment process and working environment by respecting the principles of equal opportunities. Including but not limited to: race or ethnic origin, religion or convictions, gender identity or expression, citizenship, marital status, disability, age, or sexual orientation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help make the world more hospitable &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that’s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we’re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You’ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you’ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we’re building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you’ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It’s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;Help-make-the-world-more-hospitable&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;295&quot;&gt;Help make the world more hospitable&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;332&quot;&gt;The hospitality industry is uniquely human, and it deserves technology that&#39;s just as inspiring as the people behind it. At Mews, we&#39;re transforming the industry with a platform that helps hotels run smarter, move faster and create better guest experiences. You&#39;ll work with smart, curious people who care deeply about what they do. You&#39;ll have autonomy and the trust to make good decisions and move quickly. And you&#39;ll enjoy a real sense of purpose as you see the impact of what we&#39;re building. If you&#39;re motivated by ownership, curiosity and meaningful impact, and are driven to deliver consistent high performance, you&#39;ll feel at home here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;About-the-role&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;977&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;993&quot;&gt;Let&#39;s get into the specifics. It&#39;s impossible to capture every nuance of a role – especially at a rapidly growing company like Mews – but if we had to distil it into a job description (which we do because this is a job description), it would be this:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1245&quot;&gt;The Guest Revenue tribe owns the products that help hotels earn more from every guest interaction: our booking engine, upselling tools, ancillary revenue features, and the guest recognition layer that makes personalization possible. You&#39;ll sit directly alongside Diana Arizmendi (Director of Product and Engineering) as her right hand on the tribe&#39;s hardest product problems: improving upsell attach rates (currently ~2%), scaling guest recognition, and shipping the Reputation Manager into GA. You won&#39;t be running discovery yourself for every feature — instead, you&#39;ll own the tribe&#39;s product context and encode your product judgment into the agents, evals, and shared systems that the Product Builders draw on autonomously. When the system doesn&#39;t produce the right output, you fix it at the root. When the tribe faces a genuinely ambiguous strategic bet, you own the answer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-you-would-do&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2242&quot;&gt;What you would do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product context your team builds from: the customer evidence, outcome definitions, prioritisation logic and decision history that makes every build decision faster and more grounded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Encode your product thinking into shared tools and systems so that good problem framing and rigorous discovery happen by default, not through constant oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery on the team&#39;s hardest open questions, from improving how guests discover and accept offers to building the data layer that makes guest recognition reliable at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Director of Product and Engineering on complex strategic calls, cross functional alignment and the decisions that have the most long term leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Staff Engineers and Staff Designers to make sure product decisions hold up technically and create experiences guests actually notice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5562&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI Fluency Level 3:&lt;/strong&gt; in this role, that means you design the agents and shared workflows your product builders use to turn customer evidence into decisions, not just use AI tools yourself. You build an approach to discovery and context management that others on the team can pick up and run with on their own, and you are the one who checks whether an AI generated recommendation actually holds up before it shapes a commercial decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6000&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;For more information on AI fluency at Mews, please refer to &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0bjKvDcjp5 _0WKd3G4z3T _23rrnHo10F _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9DjOvk _3932vv0Rl6 _02cRtH6wH8 _1B4rbIo10F _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGijOvk _0NqVRt0Rl6 _3BKYwu6wH8 _3sFUREDdj4 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://mews.atlassian.net/wiki/x/XQOskg&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;AI Fluency at Mews: A Comprehensive Guide for Candidates&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt; on Confluence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;What-you-would-bring&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3331&quot;&gt;What you would bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6179&quot;&gt;Staff or Principal level product experience: you have led the strategy for a meaningful product surface in B2B SaaS, and you set direction rather than execute it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6345&quot;&gt;A commercial mindset: you naturally reason in outcomes, revenue and business impact, and you can speak to how your product decisions moved a metric that mattered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6511&quot;&gt;AI Fluency Level 3 or the equivalent hands on experience: you have redesigned how a team works using AI, built an approach others followed, and you actively check AI output rather than taking it at face value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6724&quot;&gt;Technical fluency: you hold your own in engineering conversations, understand trade offs at the architecture level, and can translate technical constraints into product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6907&quot;&gt;Experience building reusable product systems: you have encoded your thinking into frameworks, agents or tooling that others actually use, not just documentation that lives in a wiki.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Czechia&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 491 000 Kč&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;2 519 000 Kč CZK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;UK&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£81,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£107,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Sweden&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;849 000 kr&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;1 333 000 kr SEK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Ireland&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€91.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€125.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary ranges are provided in good faith and reflect current market conditions and internal pay structures. Final compensation may be adjusted based on funding, budget constraints, or exceptional candidate qualifications, but will remain within reasonable proximity to the stated range.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This salary disclosure is provided in compliance with applicable pay transparency legislation. We are committed to equal pay practices and prohibit salary history inquiries during our recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If the location you&#39;re applying from wasn&#39;t originally advertised for this role, salary range information is available upon request at any point during the application/interview process - your recruiter will be able to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our success is powered by our incredible people, supported by benefits that help them thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No matter where you’re based, you’ll enjoy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited paid holiday (yes, really)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in our company share program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (6 months fully paid for primary caregivers, 2 months for secondary, available after one year of service)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual Learning budget of €300 (and more for high performers) to support your development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly &quot;EDGE&quot; time to Explore, Develop, Grow, and Elevate yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A work from anywhere policy with flexibility to work abroad for a few weeks each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation options, available after one year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A home office setup budget to make your workspace your own and a monthly work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claude tokens, so you can automate workflows and build smarter, more efficient ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive additional benefits that vary by location, from healthcare and retirement plans to team events, socials and other perks. Ask us about it during your interview process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Mews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunities employer. We value teams that reflect the diversity of the customers and communities we serve. Different perspectives make better ideas, stronger products and a more welcoming company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also believe transparency is important when deciding if you&#39;re the right fit. Mews is an ambitious, high-pressure environment of continuous learning and high standards. Success here requires resilience, adaptability and a willingness to solve difficult problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A few things that define how we work:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High autonomy means high responsibility. People are expected to take ownership and drive outcomes. There isn’t a detailed playbook for everything, and that’s part of what makes the work challenging – and rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change is constant. We’re growing quickly and adapting as we scale. Teams, processes and priorities continue to evolve, and only people who stay curious and agile will thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re remote-first, not relationship-free. Flexibility is core to how we work, but strong relationships still matter. Our teams are global, so we need expert collaborators and communicators to help us move forward together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is an integral part of our processes. It’s not here to steal people’s jobs, but to amplify efficiency and productivity. We’re motivated to proactively use the technology to seek out better ways of working and share our findings with the rest of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If there&#39;s anything we can do to support you during the application process, let us know.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We don&#39;t discriminate on the basis of race, religion, colour, nationality, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One final thing: don&#39;t hold back. If you don&#39;t meet 100% of the criteria in this job description but you&#39;re certain you could make a big impact, apply. Everyone should have equal access to opportunities, and we&#39;re committed to providing an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If Mews sounds like the kind of environment where you&#39;d thrive, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic is looking for an exceptional delivery consulting leader — someone who has built and run international delivery organisations, understands how to drive bookings growth and revenue expansion inside complex enterprise accounts, and can operate at the highest levels of client engagement while simultaneously leading and transforming a mid-sized, globally distributed team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the international Delivery Management function across Elastic Professional Services — leading the team, driving the transformation, and acting as the senior client presence on our most strategic engagements. You will be accountable for both the operational health of the delivery organisation and the commercial outcomes it generates: bookings, revenue, and margin across EMEA and APJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Delivery excellence is your foundation. Commercial growth is your north star. Building the team that industrialises both — and equips it for an AI-enabled future — is your legacy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;International Delivery Organisation — EMEA &amp;amp; APJ&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Own and lead the international Delivery Management function&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; a team of ~15 Delivery Managers today, distributed across global delivery hubs in EMEA and APJ — with a clear mandate and expectation to scale substantially through 2027 and 2028 as the practice grows and demand accelerates across both regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Drive a team transformation &lt;/strong&gt;— reframing how Delivery Managers operate, shifting from project execution to outcome-led consulting, equipping the team to hold more strategic client conversations and drive greater account value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Champion and drive the adoption of Fixed Price engagement models&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; leading the organisation through the commercial, contractual, and delivery discipline required to scope, price, and execute fixed-price engagements with confidence, especially with platform migrations — protecting margin while driving predictable, high-quality client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Build a dual-mode delivery capability that operates with excellence across two distinct motions:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;①&amp;nbsp; Packaged Solutions&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; —&amp;nbsp; fast, repeatable, industrialised delivery of high-value outcome-based offerings at scale — anchored in Fixed Price commercial models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;②&amp;nbsp; Transformative Engagements&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; —&amp;nbsp; large, complex migrations and solution delivery that require senior delivery governance, deep client partnership, and adaptive programme leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Lead the integration of AI into the Delivery Management function&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; identifying and embedding AI-powered tools and practices that improve team productivity, sharpen delivery insight, and — critically — enrich the client experience by enabling more proactive, personalised, and higher-value engagement throughout the delivery lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Design and embed delivery standards, frameworks, and tooling&lt;/strong&gt; — including AI-augmented capabilities — that enable the team to scale both delivery modes without sacrificing quality or client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Act as a player-coach&lt;/strong&gt; — maintaining direct governance oversight on the most complex or at-risk international engagements, intervening and course-correcting where needed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Build a coaching and development culture within the team&lt;/strong&gt; — raising the floor on delivery craft and the ceiling on consulting commerciality across every region working closely with the Regional Services Directors, to generate new opportunities on the back of outstanding delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Leadership &amp;amp; Commercial Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Own financial accountability across the international delivery portfolio&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; driving consulting bookings growth from delivery, maximising revenue realisation from engagements, and actively improving delivery margin through disciplined engagement management, Fixed Price adoption, and commercial rigour.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Grow the consulting footprint&lt;/strong&gt; within a portfolio of strategic enterprise accounts across EMEA and APJ, driving land-and-expand value outcomes in close partnership with regional Sales organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Build and sustain C-level and VP-level executive relationships&lt;/strong&gt; that extend beyond the project — becoming the trusted advisor clients return to for their most important decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸ &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Develop compelling value narratives&lt;/strong&gt; that articulate the value of engaging Elastic&#39;s consulting services, influencing renewal, expansion, and new commercial commitments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸ &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partner with Regional Services Directors on pipeline development&lt;/strong&gt; — acting as a senior consulting delivery voice in pre-sales conversations, solution framing, and commercial structuring including Fixed Price proposals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Organisational Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Serve as the connective tissue between Consulting, Sales, Customer Success, and Product when driving an engagement — ensuring a unified client experience and shared accountability for outcomes across EMEA and APJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Contribute to the evolution of Elastic&#39;s delivery consulting go-to-market: methodology design, packaged solution development, delivery model innovation, AI-enabled tooling, and commercial frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Represent Elastic Professional Services at the senior leadership level — internally and externally — with the credibility and presence to influence how the organisation grows internationally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;International enterprise leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Proven track record building and leading delivery teams across EMEA and/or APJ. You understand how regional culture, client expectations, and hub-based delivery dynamics shape outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Fixed Price engagement expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have designed, sold, and delivered Fixed Price consulting engagements at scale. You understand the scoping rigour, risk management, and delivery discipline required to make this model work — and you have driven its adoption across a delivery organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Financial accountability&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have owned a P&amp;amp;L or delivery portfolio with direct accountability for bookings, revenue, and margin — and you have a track record of improving all three.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Dual-mode delivery experience&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have designed and operated delivery models that handle both high-velocity repeatable engagements and complex, multi-stakeholder transformations — simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;AI fluency in a delivery context&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have a clear point of view on how AI can transform delivery management and client engagement — and you have practical experience applying AI tools to improve team effectiveness, delivery quality, or customer outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Commercial acumen&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have expanded client accounts, shaped SOWs, and driven revenue growth from within a delivery or consulting organisation. You know how value conversations are won.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Executive presence&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You are credible at the C-suite level across multiple geographies. You have built relationships that outlast individual projects and turned delivery success into long-term strategic partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;People leadership at scale&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; You have led and transformed mid-to-large delivery teams, building coaching cultures that raise performance and commerciality across a distributed, multi-timezone workforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;12+ years&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; in management consulting, professional services, or enterprise SaaS delivery leadership — with meaningful time spent in both client-facing growth roles and people/org leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Experience industrialising packaged service offerings — creating repeatable, Fixed Price delivery motions from complex, bespoke prior engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Hands-on experience deploying AI tools within a professional services or consulting delivery environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Background spanning pre-sales/solutioning and post-sales delivery — the full consulting lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Experience with enterprise SaaS platforms (e.g. Elastic, Salesforce, ServiceNow, Databricks) in a consulting or professional services capacity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Agile and hybrid delivery framework fluency in complex, multi-stakeholder enterprise environments, but with extensive experience of platform migrations / tools consolidation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;▸&amp;nbsp; Certifications (PMP, CSM, or equivalent) are valued, though leadership track record and client outcomes matter more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic&#39;s Professional Services organisation is at an inflection point internationally. We are scaling a delivery team across EMEA and APJ — with significant headcount growth expected through 2027 and 2028 — building a dual-mode delivery capability, shifting to Fixed Price engagement models, embedding AI into how we deliver and engage clients, and growing a client base that demands senior, outcome-focused leadership. All at once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries real financial weight and a real transformation mandate. You will have the authority to reshape how an international team operates, the commercial platform to build lasting client partnerships across two major regions, and the executive visibility to influence how Elastic goes to market with its consulting capability globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have built delivery organisations, owned the numbers, led through transformation, embraced AI as a genuine force multiplier, and made Fixed Price work where others haven&#39;t — and you are looking for a role where all of it matters — this is it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Information - We Take Care of Our People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a distributed company, diversity drives our identity. Whether you’re looking to launch a new career or grow an existing one, Elastic is the type of company where you can balance great work with great life. Your age is only a number. It doesn’t matter if you’re just out of college or your children are; we need you for what you can do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We strive to have parity of benefits across regions and while regulations differ from place to place, we believe taking care of our people is the right thing to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay based on the work you do here and not your previous salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health coverage for you and your family in many locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft your calendar with flexible locations and schedules for many roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous number of vacation days each year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increase your impact - We match up to $2000 (or local currency equivalent) for financial donations and service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 40 hours each year to use toward volunteer projects you love&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embracing parenthood with minimum of 16 weeks of parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Different people approach problems differently. We need that. Elastic is an equal opportunity employer and is committed to creating an inclusive culture that celebrates different perspectives, experiences, and backgrounds. Qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, color, religion, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender perception or identity, national origin, age, marital status, protected veteran status, disability status, or any other basis protected by federal, state or local law, ordinance or regulation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome individuals with disabilities and strive to create an accessible and inclusive experience for all individuals. To request an accommodation during the application or the recruiting process, please email &lt;a ----- ----- class=&quot;gmail_default&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;We will reply to your request within 24 business hours of submission.&lt;/p&gt;
