&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A career driven by you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join AutoScout24 Group and experience life in the fast lane. We’re not just leading the market; we’re creating it. We’re constantly innovating, evolving and transforming things for our customers. We’re driven, ambitious and determined to do our best work, together. For a career that doesn’t stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our international community.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:257}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As an Engineering Manager, you will lead a team within one domain, building a high-performing environment that solves user problems and delivers measurable business value. You will combine people leadership with technical judgement, partner closely with Product and UX, and take accountability for delivery and the systems your team owns.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role spans people, delivery, technology, financials and business. You will understand the current position in each area and focus on the priorities that matter most at a given time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Team leadership and development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, coach and develop a high-performing team. Identify capability gaps, break down knowledge silos, hire the right talent and support both top performers and people who need to improve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment of trust, candid feedback, learning and psychological safety. Monitor morale and wellbeing, address productivity blockers and handle difficult conversations when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations, support individual growth paths and hold people accountable for commitments. Delegate effectively, balancing autonomy, guidance and learning, and empower the team to make decisions aligned with company priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain management decisions clearly, challenge constructively and commit to agreed decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Delivery and collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own team capacity, work in progress, output and engineering outcomes. Partner with Product and UX on feasible roadmaps, milestones and capacity allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and review technical initiatives, technical debt reduction and operational work. Define engineering excellence metrics, assess cost and value, contribute to design documents and refine effort estimates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate proactively with stakeholders and other teams. Resolve blockers through alternative solutions with clear ownership and timelines, or escalate when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognise when business problems could benefit from machine learning and align initiative planning with data teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure security and regulatory compliance for the systems your team owns, including timely remediation or formal risk acknowledgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Technology and operational excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand your team’s services, architecture and data flows. Guide technical decisions, review design options for resilience, cost and performance, explain trade-offs and contribute hands-on when time allows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply threat modelling, secure design principles and mandatory security training. Avoid accidental complexity and use established practices, platform capabilities and AutoScout24 engineering values and principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure actionable monitoring and alerting. Define and refine service level objectives with stakeholders, review reliability and performance, and act when objectives are missed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Where on-call is required, establish sustainable rotations, shared knowledge and incident practice. Follow incident and security escalation processes, conduct post-incident reviews and complete improvement actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make business data available through the data platform, maintain its metadata and take responsibility for its quality, availability and consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Financials and business impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor infrastructure and licence costs, plan mitigating actions and involve the group director and Finance when needed. Support budget planning, follow procurement guidelines and align capitalisable product capacity with Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align team priorities with company strategy and stakeholder needs. Negotiate trade-offs across timing, quality and scope to maximise value and learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the business impact of releases, use product metrics to inform recommendations and show how the team contributes to company goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to cross-team initiatives by identifying improvements, defining and delivering tasks, and presenting outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry experience consistent with Engineering Manager scope, typically 8+ years, with the ability to lead and develop an engineering team within one domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with mobile engineering teams and a solid understanding of React Native, including its architecture, development practices and the challenges of building and maintaining high-quality cross-platform applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical judgement and understanding of software architecture, operational reliability, security and the systems your team owns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to coach, delegate, give direct feedback and manage challenging people and leadership situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience planning capacity, delivering engineering outcomes and working effectively with Product, UX, data teams and other stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of business metrics, financial trade-offs and fundamental data science concepts, combined with clear prioritisation and communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A culture of growth&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we&#39;re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we&#39;re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you&#39;ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.A culture of growth &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;With over 50 nationalities represented, we’re proud to welcome people of all backgrounds to our growing community, and we’re always finding new ways to help people feel welcomed and included. Here, you’ll have the tools, training and support you need to work in a way that suits you, learn new skills and reach your potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For a career where you can drive our business and shape your future, apply now.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, we’re Phiture — the mobile growth consultancy working with the teams behind leading apps like Adobe, Headspace, and LEGO® 👋. We’re setting the standard for growth in the brave new digital world, and we need great people to join our global team!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join Phiture as a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Growth Consultant, PM&lt;/strong&gt;, owning the day-to-day relationship, communication, and delivery for one of our largest and most demanding accounts. You&#39;ll act as one of the main points of contact for client communications, owning conversations and decisions directly with the client, orchestrating across PM, ASO, and Creative, while advising the Growth Lead on strategy and execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, individual account-ownership role that requires both strong technical craftsmanship and genuine comfort leading client conversations. &lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition for mobile apps, including GAC, Apple Search Ads, MMPs&lt;/strong&gt;, and attribution, and pair it with the confidence to represent the account&#39;s strategy directly to senior, demanding stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Paid UA Campaign Management&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the end-to-end strategy, setup, and continuous optimization of paid campaigns (Google App Campaigns, Apple Search Ads, Meta Ads and other UA channels as relevant) to scale user acquisition efficiently, proactively monitoring spend efficiency and creative performance, and independently investigating technical issues (tracking discrepancies, delivery problems, attribution mismatches) before escalating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Client Relationship&lt;/strong&gt;: Own the client relationship end-to-end with day-to-day communication, deliverables (reports, proposals, strategic planning docs), and hands-on execution of the agreed strategy. Lead client meetings, educate clients beyond reporting, and communicate the real, accurate cause of any issue, including when it traces back to our own setup or execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, Not Just Attend, Client Conversations&lt;/strong&gt;: Confidently drive client meetings, questioning client requests that don&#39;t hold up, proactively bringing recommendations rather than waiting to be asked, and representing the account&#39;s strategic direction directly to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect PM to ASO and Creative&lt;/strong&gt;: Actively bring the organic and creative perspective into paid conversations (and vice versa) rather than staying within a single channel, by flagging cross-functional implications to the wider team without needing to be prompted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply App-Specific Paid Media Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;: Bring deep expertise in paid user acquisition specifically for mobile apps, SDKs and their implementation, SKAN&#39;s measurement restrictions and their implications for testing and attribution, and what an MMP does and why app marketers rely on one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze Performance &amp;amp; Drive Recommendations&lt;/strong&gt;: Dive deep into monthly metrics, set targets, analyze trends, and independently identify areas of concern or opportunity, arriving with a point of view and a recommendation grounded in the numbers, translated into what it means for the client&#39;s business. Comfort reading dashboards in a tool like Looker Studio is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide Client POCs &amp;amp; Junior Team Members&lt;/strong&gt;: Guide Client POCs and junior team members as they build expertise, while retaining individual ownership of your own accounts. Given a problem, investigate it, propose a course of action, follow through, and close the loop with stakeholders without needing reminders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL NEED:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ years of hands-on experience in paid user acquisition / performance marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, for mobile apps, with a track record of demonstrable results (efficiency gains, scaled spend, measurable campaign impact) you can speak to concretely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid app-specific paid UA fluency&lt;/strong&gt;: including GAC, Meta Ads, Apple Search Ads, SDKs, SKAN, and MMP concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on attribution/MMP experience&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable troubleshooting tracking and attribution issues directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Genuine confidence leading client meetings&lt;/strong&gt;: with a track record of proactively driving conversations and pushing back on client asks when warranted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent data interpretation skills&lt;/strong&gt;: able to arrive at a point of view and recommendation grounded in the numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in English, with excellent written and spoken client communication skills&lt;/strong&gt; and being able to simplify technical concepts for less growth-literate stakeholders without losing substance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A demonstrated track record of proactive ownership&lt;/strong&gt;: able to walk through a real past troubleshooting or client-management example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with kids/family-audience apps&lt;/strong&gt; or highly regulated/brand-sensitive clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familiarity with programmatic/DSP media buying&lt;/strong&gt; is a big plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience working alongside a dedicated data/attribution specialist&lt;/strong&gt;: comfortable collaborating closely with a technical counterpart.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Remote Work&lt;/strong&gt; — Unlimited remote work within your home country (EMEA), plus up to 90 days per year internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous Vacation Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy up to 30 days of paid vacation annually, plus extra days for special occasions (country-specific), so you can recharge and pursue your passions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quarterly Bonus Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt; — Boost your earnings through our quarterly bonus scheme, directly linked to our shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mental Wellness Prioritized&lt;/strong&gt; — Free, confidential mental health support from licensed therapists through our partnership with Oliva.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development Investment&lt;/strong&gt; — €1,000 annual personal growth budget and 10 dedicated learning hours each month, empowering your continuous growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Working Hours&lt;/strong&gt; — Shape your workday around your lifestyle and productivity, choosing working patterns that best suit you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vibrant Berlin Office&lt;/strong&gt; — Enjoy a flexible, pet-friendly workspace at our spacious headquarters located in one of Berlin’s most vibrant neighborhoods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Team Connection&lt;/strong&gt; — Regular team-building events and a memorable annual all-expenses-paid company offsite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tailored Career Growth&lt;/strong&gt; — A personalized career roadmap and development plan designed to keep you advancing professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Home Office Allowance&lt;/strong&gt; — Monthly remote-work cash allowance to level up your home workspace or help cover internet costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Premium Onboarding Kit&lt;/strong&gt; — Branded Phiture gear and your very own MacBook from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thoughtful Celebrations&lt;/strong&gt; — Responsibly sourced birthday, anniversary, and seasonal gifts, because every milestone deserves recognition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We encourage all qualified individuals to apply, regardless of their age, gender identity, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability status, or religion. We celebrate diversity and are excited about building teams that represent a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. All employment decisions are based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world&#39;s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone&#39;s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Stripe EMEA Marketing team is a dynamic and rapidly growing group dedicated to transforming customers into enthusiastic advocates for Stripe. Collaborating closely with sales, we focus on accelerating the path to purchase and enhancing product adoption among our user base. Our regional marketing efforts involve crafting and executing tailored marketing plans that resonate with local audiences, as well as spearheading our most significant conferences and sponsorships that drive go-to-market success and business growth. Join us and be part of a culture that celebrates teamwork, innovates boldly, and makes a meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a strategic, results-oriented marketing leader to drive our marketing engine for SMB and Mid-Market segments across EMEA, with an emphasis on Ideal Customer Profiles. This segment represents a massive portion of Europe’s economic fabric and is a critical driver of our ambitions in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role for someone who thrives at the intersection of strategy, execution, and cross-functional influence. You&#39;ll translate global priorities into locally resonant programs, ensuring that audiences in the SMB and Mid-Market space have high-quality, insight-driven experiences throughout their lifecycle, from early exploration to long-term partnership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is data-driven, has an unbridled passion for working hand-in-hand with regional sales teams to drive successful user outcomes, and is excited about building a high-velocity revenue engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the EMEA marketing strategy for SMB and Mid-Market segments with an emphasis on Ideal Customer Profiles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own key business and revenue metrics throughout the sales funnel, with a strong emphasis on accelerating pipeline through upsell and cross-sell opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Partner Marketing to create successful co-selling initiatives that extend our reach within the partner and developer ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute comprehensive full-funnel marketing plans, partnering with digital marketing and demand generation teams to secure high-value deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Sales leadership to align account plans, ensure disciplined lead follow-up, and establish trust as a strategic partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with EMEA demand generation and product marketing to identify, scope, and produce or localize compelling content and marketing assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, measure, and communicate program results, continually optimizing for efficiency and scale while seeking to generate new global best practices, and innovate ways to educate a diverse range of personas about the value that Stripe delivers to businesses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of relevant B2B marketing experience in the EMEA technology market, including specific experience with demand generation and field marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of defining and executing B2B marketing strategies that successfully drive metrics, key performance indicators, and pipeline generation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to convey complex topics with simplicity to diverse audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic mindset with strong problem-solving capabilities and a data-driven approach to decision-making, along with a deep understanding of full-funnel journeys and marketing technology like Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling programs through agency resources and collaborating across key go-to-market stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A startup mentality with a bias to action and the ability to flex in a fast-paced industry and work environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the payments, financial technology, or adjacent industries, or marketing FinTech solutions or to FinTech companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the payments, financial technology, and ecommerce industries and partner ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success delivering marketing programs with and through consulting and technology partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy Health DACH ist eine grenzenlos agierende Kreativagentur, die durch nahtlose Zusammenarbeit über Disziplinen und Märkte hinweg Projekte realisiert – von lokalen Initiativen bis hin zu globalen Kampagnen. Unser Team arbeitet an der Schnittstelle von &lt;strong&gt;Healthcare, Social Media, Strategie, Experience und Influence&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Von Zürich aus betreuen wir das Healthcare-Portfolio von Ogilvy für die DACH-Region sowie ausgewählte internationale Kund:innen aus den Bereichen Pharma, Biotech und Medizintechnik. Unser interdisziplinäres Health-Team vereint Account Management, Medical Writing, PR, Digital, Strategie und Kreation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zum nächstmöglichen Zeitpunkt suchen wir eine:n&lt;strong&gt; Designer/ Art Director Health (m/w/d)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;in Berlin, Hamburg, Frankfurt/ Main, Düsseldorf oder Zürich.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Das bieten wir:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Möglichkeit zur Arbeit im Mobile Office (bis zu 100%)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nutzung unseres&amp;nbsp;WPP Weiterbildungsnetzwerkes, inkl. LinkedIn Learning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei der privaten Altersvorsorge und die Gewährung von vermögenswirksamen Leistungen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jubiläumsprämien in Form von zusätzlichen Urlaubstagen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Möglichkeit zur Nutzung eines Job Bikes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erweiterte Betriebliche Krankenversicherung mit einem zusätzlichen Budget von bis zu 300€ im Jahr&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zugriff auf unser&amp;nbsp;Employee&amp;nbsp;Assistance Programm&amp;nbsp;TELUS Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kostenlose Nutzung der&amp;nbsp;Headspace-App&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subventionierte&amp;nbsp;Gympass-Mitgliedschaft&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deine Aufgaben:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Art Director Health entwickelst und gestaltest du Kommunikationslösungen für renommierte Kund:innen aus dem Healthcare- und Pharmabereich. Dein Aufgabenspektrum reicht – je nach Projekt – von konkreten Kommunikationsmitteln wie Flyern, Broschüren, Präsentationen und Sales-Materialien bis hin zu visuellen Identitäten, digitalen Inhalten und integrierten Kampagnen.&lt;br&gt;Du entwickelst starke visuelle Konzepte, übersetzt medizinische und wissenschaftliche Inhalte in klare, relevante Kommunikation und begleitest Projekte von der ersten Idee bis zur finalen Umsetzung. Dabei arbeitest du eng mit Medical Writing, Client Services, Strategie, Creative Direction, Digital, PR, Production und externen Partner:innen zusammen.&lt;br&gt;Die Rolle erfordert kreative Exzellenz und ein gutes Verständnis für die besonderen Anforderungen der Healthcare-Kommunikation – insbesondere für Rx-Produkte, regulatorische Vorgaben und Review-Prozesse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Konzeption und Gestaltung von Kommunikationsmitteln für Print, Digital, Social Media und Bewegtbild – von Flyern, Broschüren und Präsentationen bis zu digitalen Assets und Kampagnenformaten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entwicklung visueller Identitäten, Corporate Designs, Branding-Lösungen, Kampagnenwelten und visueller Narrative für Pharma-, Biotech- und Medtech-Kund:innen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Übersetzung medizinischer und wissenschaftlicher Inhalte in klare, zielgruppengerechte und visuell überzeugende Lösungen, insbesondere für Rx-, Disease-Awareness- und Patient-Engagement-Projekte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Präsentation und überzeugende Vermittlung von Ideen gegenüber Kund:innen sowie Begleitung der Umsetzung und Sicherstellung der gestalterischen Qualität über alle Kanäle und Formate hinweg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zusammenarbeit mit internen Fachbereichen und externen Partner:innen wie Fotograf:innen, Filmproduktionen, Freelancer:innen und Partneragenturen sowie Unterstützung bei Pitches, Neugeschäftsprojekten und der Weiterentwicklung bestehender Kund:innenbeziehungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Was du mitbringst:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abgeschlossene Ausbildung als Grafiker:in EFZ, Studium in Visueller Kommunikation, Grafikdesign oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation sowie mehrjährige Berufserfahrung als Art Director in einer Healthcare-, Pharma- oder Kommunikationsagentur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fundierte Erfahrung in der Zusammenarbeit mit Kund:innen aus Pharma, Biotech und/oder Medtech sowie nachweisbare Erfahrung mit Kommunikationsmassnahmen für Rx-Produkte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gutes Verständnis für medizinische Inhalte, regulatorische Anforderungen und Review-Prozesse in der Healthcare-Kommunikation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte konzeptionelle und gestalterische Fähigkeiten, ein überzeugendes Portfolio sowie sicherer Umgang mit der Adobe Creative Cloud und gängigen Design- und Präsentationstools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Kommunikations- und Präsentationsfähigkeiten, ein sicheres Auftreten gegenüber Kund:innen sowie sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit Patient Engagement, PR- und Awareness-Kampagnen sowie Kenntnisse in Motion Design und Social/Digital Content Creation sind ein Plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verbindest kreative Exzellenz mit strategischem Denken und kannst komplexe Inhalte schnell erfassen und in relevante visuelle Ideen übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest proaktiv, selbständig, lösungsorientiert und zuverlässig – sowohl an grösseren Projekten als auch an konkreten Kommunikationsmitteln im Tagesgeschäft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kommunizierst klar, präsentierst sicher und kannst Kund:innen für deine Ideen begeistern. Die Zusammenarbeit in interdisziplinären und internationalen Teams macht dir Freude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst Resilienz und Flexibilität für einen dynamischen und phasenweise intensiven Agenturalltag mit. Nicht alles ist planbar, Prioritäten und Timings können sich kurzfristig ändern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auch bei hohem Tempo und mehreren parallelen Projekten bewahrst du den Überblick, hast einen hohen Qualitätsanspruch und übernimmst Verantwortung. In intensiven Phasen bist du bereit, gemeinsam mit dem Team die Extrameile zu gehen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir glauben an die Kraft von Diversität und Kollaboration. Den Herausforderungen der heutigen Welt können wir nur gemeinsam begegnen.&amp;nbsp;Wir verpflichten uns daher, für den Job in Frage kommende Bewerber:innen ausschließlich nach ihren Fähigkeiten und grundsätzlich unabhängig von Alter, Geschlecht, ethnischer Zugehörigkeit, sexueller Orientierung, Behinderung oder Religion zu beurteilen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Das klingt nach einer spannenden Herausforderung? Sehr gut, dein Ansprechpartner Kai Schlüter freut sich über deine Bewerbung!&lt;br&gt;Aus Gründen der Nachhaltigkeit und des Datenschutzes bitten wir darum, Bewerbungsunterlagen ausschließlich über unsere Bewerber:innenplattform Greenhouse an uns zu senden. Wir würden uns freuen, wenn auf das Mitsenden eines Fotos verzichtet würde.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need any assistance seeking a job opportunity, or if you need reasonable accommodation with the application process, please contact us at ----- Please note that this contact is only for candidates who are requesting accommodation. Emails for other purposes, including application status requests, will not receive a response.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Celonis&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and operational intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand—turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. By providing the essential business context that AI agents and tools need to act effectively, Celonis makes AI truly enterprise-ready.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global partner ecosystem to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together to achieve transformational outcomes. Headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, Celonis operates globally with over 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based at our global headquarters in &lt;strong&gt;Munich&lt;/strong&gt;, as a &lt;strong&gt;Value Engineering Manager / Director&lt;/strong&gt; for &lt;strong&gt;CPG &amp;amp; Retail&lt;/strong&gt;, you will hold full operational and leadership responsibility specifically for the &lt;strong&gt;CPG &amp;amp; Retail segment across the DACH region&lt;/strong&gt;. In this role, you will lead a dedicated, high-performing team of 6–7 Value Engineers operating at the intersection of process transformation, executive consulting, and AI-driven product execution, driving the end-to-end customer value journey and accelerating enterprise AI adoption across major retail and consumer goods brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will serve as a player-coach, actively guiding, coaching, and developing a talented, high-potential team with diverse backgrounds spanning supply chain, procurement, management consulting, and retail operations. This role offers tremendous growth potential as you both develop and learn alongside top-tier talent, while serving as a trusted advisor to C-level executives at major enterprise accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Sets Our Patch Apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The DACH CPG &amp;amp; Retail patch represents some of the world&#39;s most recognizable consumer brands, retail giants, and mobility innovators.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our DACH CPG &amp;amp; Retail customers navigate complex global supply chains, omnichannel fulfillment challenges, and the rapid rise of Process Intelligence and Agentic AI, you will engage directly—in both German and English—with vocal customer champions, C-level decision-makers, and pioneering thought leaders shaping the future of retail and consumer goods innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Business Outcomes &amp;amp; Account Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Take full ownership of ARR targets, renewal forecasts, and net retention across the DACH CPG &amp;amp; Retail sector. Ensure high forecasting accuracy and steer accounts toward tangible, realized value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Coaching:&lt;/strong&gt; Recruit, onboard, lead, and mentor a team of 6–7 Munich-based Value Engineers. Maintain high standards through proactive coaching, performance management, and career progression planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Advisory &amp;amp; Player-Coach:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as a Celonis Executive Sponsor on critical DACH deals. Join your team in the field to lead high-impact executive meetings, dry runs, value sprints, and strategic transformation workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise AI Champion:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with customer executives to position Celonis as the foundation for modern process intelligence, digital operational excellence, and next-generation Agentic AI adoption using our Context Model and Digital Twin capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem &amp;amp; Partner Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Cultivate executive-level relationships across regional partner networks, services teams, and account executives to align CPG and retail customer strategies with Celonis AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Standardize and scale best practices, reusable solution blueprints, and CPG/Retail industry-specific frameworks internally and across external customer communities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Behaviors We Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Business Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt; Focus on top- and bottom-line impact, maintaining green customer health and expanding retention across new logos and key enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Motivate, Develop &amp;amp; Nurture Talent:&lt;/strong&gt; Build an inclusive, high-trust environment that attracts top-tier external talent, retains top performers, accelerates individual growth, and addresses underperformance early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead by Example:&lt;/strong&gt; Embody the &quot;player/coach&quot; mentality, maintaining an active on-site presence with priority accounts and upholding strict quality standards across all engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think BIG, Be BOLD:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion an entrepreneurial growth mindset by expanding your internal/external network, spearheading new go-to-market motions, and positioning Celonis as an essential innovation driver in retail and consumer goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Scope&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Native or business-fluent &lt;strong&gt;German&lt;/strong&gt; (spoken and written) and fluent &lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; are required to interface effectively with executive decision-makers across the DACH market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Based in or willing to relocate to &lt;strong&gt;Munich&lt;/strong&gt;, with willingness to travel to customer sites across Germany, Austria, and Switzerland as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven Leadership Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record leading pre-sales, management consulting, or value engineering teams within Enterprise SaaS, Enterprise AI, or Management Consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep domain familiarity with supply chain, procurement, fulfillment, and operational processes within the CPG &amp;amp; Retail industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to directly manage or mentor a team of 6–7 high-performing individual contributors, with a strong passion for team coaching and talent development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong business acumen with experience owning ACV, net retention, and renewal pipeline metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Outstanding executive presence with a proven track record of building C-level relationships across global brands and regional retail leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with the leading, award-winning process mining technology, shaping the future of business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accelerate Your Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Benefit from clear career paths, internal mobility, a dedicated learning program, and mentorship opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Receive Exceptional Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Including generous PTO, hybrid working options, company equity (RSUs), comprehensive benefits, extensive parental leave, dedicated volunteer days, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.celonis.com/life-at-celonis/benefits&quot;&gt;much more&lt;/a&gt;. Interns and working students explore your benefits &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.celonis.com/early-careers&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prioritize Your Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt; Access to resources such as gym subsidies, counseling, and well-being programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect and Belong:&lt;/strong&gt; Find community and support through dedicated inclusion and belonging programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make Meaningful Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Be part of a company driven by strong &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.celonis.com/life-at-celonis/values&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt; that guide everything we do: Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate Globally:&lt;/strong&gt; Join a dynamic, international team of talented individuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute your ideas in an open culture with autonomous teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Celonis makes processes work for people, companies and the planet. The Celonis Process Intelligence Platform uses industry-leading process mining and AI technology and augments it with business context to give customers a living digital twin of their business operation. It’s system-agnostic and without bias, and provides everyone with a common language for understanding and improving businesses. Celonis enables its customers to continuously realize significant value across the top, bottom, and green line. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a href=&quot;https://academy.celonis.com/learn/video/discover-the-ems&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
