&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;is a technology company dedicated to changing data ownership for good. We empower businesses and individuals with control and ownership of their data, with a comprehensive approach to managing their holistic identity – accounting for all aspects of their digital footprint while ensuring privacy and security. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s technology enables users to benefit from decentralised digital identity solutions. We believe that everyone has the right to own and control their data, and we are committed to creating a trusted digital credentials ecosystem that empowers businesses and individuals to securely exchange data and services across borders and industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Full Stack Engineering Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with deep expertise in &lt;strong&gt;backend systems (TypeScript, microservices, cloud)&lt;/strong&gt; to lead multiple engineering teams building the &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi Elements &lt;/strong&gt;platform. While you will manage and support teams working across the full stack (backend, frontend, platform infrastructure), your technical depth and demonstrated experience in backend engineering will be crucial in guiding architecture, ensuring quality, and driving technical strategy.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role blends &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt;: you will grow high-performing fullstack teams, define best practices across the stack, and remain hands-on in critical technical decisions to ensure our systems are secure, scalable, and performant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work culture at &lt;strong&gt;Affinidi&lt;/strong&gt; is shaped by the following tenets:   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are unapologetically customer-focused &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We invest in cultures and teams to enable high performance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Embraces experimentation and builds fast &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We have the courage to be misunderstood &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We work together to unlock data   &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple engineering teams, providing &lt;strong&gt;vision, direction, and coaching&lt;/strong&gt; to managers, staff engineers, and senior ICs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive &lt;strong&gt;engineering execution and on-time delivery&lt;/strong&gt; of secure, performant, and customer-centric systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee and contribute to the design and development of &lt;strong&gt;high-scale, high-performance distributed production systems&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, design, and business stakeholders to define and execute the &lt;strong&gt;technology roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and evolve &lt;strong&gt;engineering best practices, delivery processes, and quality standards&lt;/strong&gt; to scale effectively&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop engineering leaders, fostering &lt;strong&gt;career growth, leadership depth, and technical excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of &lt;strong&gt;emerging technologies&lt;/strong&gt;, bringing innovative approaches to improve scalability, architecture, and developer experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion &lt;strong&gt;privacy by design&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;security-first principles&lt;/strong&gt;, and high-quality engineering across backend and frontend systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt; You will be a great match if you:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading engineering organizations in global, high-growth environments while driving on-time delivery of high-quality systems at scale&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong &lt;strong&gt; leadership skills&lt;/strong&gt;: coaching, mentoring, developing leaders, and fostering high-performing, inclusive teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;strategic vision&lt;/strong&gt; with &lt;strong&gt;practical execution&lt;/strong&gt;, aligning engineering teams with business outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript/Node.js&lt;/strong&gt;; &lt;strong&gt;Dart &lt;/strong&gt;experience is preferred; familiarity with C#, Go, or similar is a plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with &lt;strong&gt; React/Next.js&lt;/strong&gt; and/or &lt;strong&gt;Flutter&lt;/strong&gt;, demonstrates solid understanding of modern web and/or mobile development practices&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate proven success in &lt;strong&gt;designing, deploying, and scaling microservices&lt;/strong&gt; in cloud environments, specifically, Amazon Web Services (AWS)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for &lt;strong&gt;privacy, security, cryptography&lt;/strong&gt;, and resilient system design; experience with &lt;strong&gt;asynchronous cryptography and identity/authentication domains&lt;/strong&gt; is a strong plus&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are skilled at balancing &lt;strong&gt;technical leadership&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;people leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, growing teams while staying engaged in critical technical decisions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at &lt;strong&gt;cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; with product, design, and security stakeholders&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrive in &lt;strong&gt;fast-moving startup environments&lt;/strong&gt;, building autonomous teams that experiment, learn, and deliver at speed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across functions, locations, and time zones&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend expertise in RUST&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in decentralized identity solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building systems with advanced cryptography requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What can you expect from us:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unlimited vacation policy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within international environment &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning Budget &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Allowance &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Urban Sport Membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sounds like you? Apply now!  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We believe in hiring different and diverse talent and providing a safe space where everyone can share their views without fear, where differences are celebrated, and where no one is left out. Inclusive cultures are the foundation for collaboration and innovation within our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this position, you confirm that you have read and understood &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Affinidi’s Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;, and consent to the collection, use, and disclosure of your personal data for recruitment purposes, as described in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.affinidi.com/assets/Candidate_Privacy_Policy-Bh-PGpoS.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Head of Design Systems&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong&gt;Brand and Design&lt;/strong&gt; team at Doctolib.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission will be to ensure every Doctolib product surface is built on a consistent, high-quality design foundation. You will own &lt;strong&gt;Oxygen&lt;/strong&gt;, Doctolib&#39;s design system - much more than a component library. Oxygen is how we deliver our brand identity consistently throughout the product and the critical infrastructure that ensures design quality at scale across an AI-first development environment. With over 50 designers and engineers building across multiple markets and product surfaces, your work will directly shape the experience of more than 90 million patients and 400,000 healthcare professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the multi-year vision and roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; for Oxygen, connecting the dots across engineering, design, and brand teams. Translate system health into business impact and own the investment strategy for the teams, tools, and governance that support it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish cross-functional governance&lt;/strong&gt; across Design, Product, Engineering, and Brand teams, defining contribution models, change management processes, and the standards other teams are expected to follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own design output quality across the product,&lt;/strong&gt; ensuring that AI-generated interfaces are coherent, consistent, and on-brand at every touchpoint across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and drive cross-organizational adoption,&lt;/strong&gt; measuring adoption rate, component coverage, and contribution velocity, and connecting those metrics to product team speed and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and grow a team of designers, product people and engineers,&lt;/strong&gt; setting career paths, a high bar for craft, and hiring for the roles the system needs next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have &lt;strong&gt;10+ years of experience in product design or design systems,&lt;/strong&gt; with a proven track record of scaling a mature, complex system across multiple product teams or lines of business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring &lt;strong&gt;engineering fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; you understand the technical architecture of a design system, how platform teams operate, and the latest best practices in AI-first software engineering as it relates to design systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have demonstrated &lt;strong&gt;senior stakeholder management skills,&lt;/strong&gt; with the ability to negotiate priorities with leadership at Director level and above across large, distributed organizations, and drive change management at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take a &lt;strong&gt;data-informed and outcome-oriented approach:&lt;/strong&gt; you measure system health in real metrics (adoption rate, handoff defect rate, contribution velocity) and connect those numbers to product quality and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience in a &lt;strong&gt;regulated, enterprise, or healthcare-adjacent context&lt;/strong&gt; where accessibility (WCAG), localization (i18n, RTL), and multi-market constraints are critical to design systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are &lt;strong&gt;fluent in English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience owning large-scale change management programs across cross-functional organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Speak additional European languages, such as French, German, or Italian&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Doctolib Tech&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to country and healthcare specialty requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of Rails, TypeScript, Java, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about our tech culture and environment? Visit the&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Doctolib Tech site&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A Deutschlandticket (Germany-wide public transport pass) fully paid for by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;28 vacation days + 1 additional day for each full calendar year of employment (up to a maximum of 30 days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Company health insurance with great supplementary benefits through our partner Allianz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Company pension scheme (bAV) through Allianz with an employer subsidy of 40% (15% within the probationary period)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;The Doctolib Parent Care program, which includes one month additional parental leave and much more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Subsidized sports membership through our partner Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A flexible workplace policy offering both hybrid and office-based mode&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Alongside healthy snacks and our regular breakfast buffet, we provide a subsidized meal benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Portfolio Review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design System Live Case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot;&gt; candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paris or Berlin&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a senior Account Executive, you&#39;ll be a key player in expanding our market presence and driving new business growth within the Enterprise sector in Germany. You will lead the full sales cycle, from prospecting to close, and be the primary point of contact for our enterprise accounts across financial services, local government and healthcare. This role is a unique opportunity to directly impact our business by building strong relationships with both customers and partners and championing our innovative solutions to solve complex business challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the full sales cycle&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our enterprise solutions, directing pursuit teams and executing strategic account plans to secure new customer acquisition and expand existing relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive revenue growth&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;by actively prospecting, building a robust pipeline, and consistently exceeding your sales quotas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop and maintain strong relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with key customers, ensuring high satisfaction and positioning Pure Storage as a trusted advisor and long-term partner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate closely with our channel partners&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to leverage their networks and expertise, positioning our solutions effectively within the market and maximizing sales opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven sales experience&lt;/strong&gt; in a direct and indirect sales environment with enterprise accounts, with a track record of exceeding quotas across financial services, local government and healthcare sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise in prospecting,&lt;/strong&gt; account planning, and relationship building with key stakeholders at all levels of an organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience working with channel partners&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and a strong understanding of how to leverage these relationships to drive sales and market penetration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A deep understanding of the storage industry,&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;cloud computing, and modern data center architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in German &amp;amp; English.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
